dsh-see-now — screen-visual pipeline (code adapted into this project)
  - Source: https://github.com/SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now
  - License: Apache License 2.0
  - Copyright © 2026 SAOS-3624
  - What was taken: the frame-selection and contact-sheet pipeline under
    src/core/vision/ (cuts / tiers / pack / scale / sheet / png / pipeline /
    capture) is a port of dsh-see-now, converted from ES modules to CommonJS
    and adapted to run inside an Electron main process instead of a DSH plugin.
    Changes: CJS packaging, an Electron-hosted session manager
    (src/core/screen-observer.js), ffmpeg path resolution for the packaged app,
    removal of the DSH-only floating window / chat-interjection layers, and a
